WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:10,030
Come on, come on. The first pot is out. Come and taste it.

2
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:13,430
Just take it out if you like it. Be careful to burn it.

3
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:21,220
Boss, boss, try it now, it’s amazing

4
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:27,340
Professional matters must be left to professionals.

5
00:00:27,340 --> 00:00:29,220
I kind of want to lure Liu Yang into the team.

6
00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:37,380
For the first time, I felt a little embarrassed

7
00:00:37,380 --> 00:00:40,420
I brought you something to eat, right?

8
00:00:45,260 --> 00:00:47,940
But it’s been a while since we’ve had food cooked over an open fire.

9
00:00:47,940 --> 00:00:53,760
Go back and help Brother Liu repair the car.

10
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:57,820
It's easy to talk. Let's go after dinner.
